          "text": "Témoignages: JOUE-LES-TOURS (37) 07.03.2015 T1 Compte rendu enquete.pdf Temoin photo.JPG PV n°250 (2015311673).pdf JOUE-LES-TOURS (37) 07.03.2015 T2",
          "text_sha256": "2c0fba981b4acf4df2192c5dffcc622355b8832642bc817f65298cd992af1470"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
          "field": "summary",
          "field_label": "Résumé",
          "language": {
            "code": "fr-FR",
